# Eighty-two UUU / block-two / position-fifteen degree-ten leaves

This module is the kernel-facing finite boundary extracted from the discovery
catalogue.  It records exactly nine representative ordered support pairs and
their 82 representative matrix words.  It makes no UNSAT or refutation claim.
The matrix words are the 105 upper-triangle colors in lexicographic edge order.
-/

